## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /RealMedia/ads/adstream_jx.ads/encar.com/{encar.comToken}` — Authenticate and retrieve ad stream.

### Data Read (9)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve data by ID.
- `GET /ew/dealership.do` — Fetch dealership information.
- `GET /mg/post.do` — Retrieve data from the /mg/post.do endpoint.
- `GET /my/{myId}` — Get user data by ID.
- `GET /nac/2` — Get data from the /nac/2 endpoint.
- `GET /nac/2/4Cp1B8wgViAI` — Get data from the /nac/2 endpoint with specific ID.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionId}/` — Retrieve conversion data by ID.
- `GET /v1/onelink` — Retrieve data from the /v1/onelink endpoint.
- `POST /{id}` — Retrieve specific data by ID.

### Data Write (2)
- `POST /dc/dc_ajaxstatscount.do` — Update statistics count.
- `POST /pr/pr_index.do` — Post data to the /pr/pr_index.do endpoint.

### Search (2)
- `GET /search/{searchId}/list/{listId}` — Search for listings based on search and list IDs.
- `GET /search/car/list/pricesupply` — Search for car listings with price and supply info.

### Media (1)
- `GET /RealMedia/ads/adstream_jx.ads/www.encar.com/home@Top2` — Retrieve media content for ads.

